plaintext
* Transistor models (assume generic NMOS and PMOS)
.model NMOS NMOS
.model PMOS PMOS

* NMOS Transistors
M1 2 4 3 3 NMOS
M2 6 5 3 3 NMOS
M3 3 9 2 2 NMOS
M4 3 9 2 2 NMOS
M5 2 9 1 1 NMOS
M6 8 9 1 1 NMOS

* PMOS Transistors
M7 9 1 2 2 PMOS
M8 9 2 2 2 PMOS

* Current Sources
I1 4 9 DC
I2 5 9 DC

* Voltage Source
VDD 9 0 DC 5V

* Nodes (for reference)
* 1: Ground
* 2: Vout1
* 3: Common source of M1, M2
* 4: Gate of M1
* 5: Gate of M2
* 6: Input (Vin)
* 7: Current source nodes
* 8: Vout2
* 9: VDD

.end